    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72578" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰνοχό-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>vessel for</i> taking wine from
			the mixing-bowl (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρατήρ</span>) and
			<i>pouring</i> it into the cups, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				744
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				361
			</span></i>, etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιάλας τε καὶ οἰ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.46
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρύσεαι οἰ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					820
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργυρᾶ</span> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αῖ</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.315.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.1388.30
			</span></i>, al. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰ. θεῶν σωτήρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					214.45
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Didyma</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of <i>sideboard</i> to range the
